# __TITLE__ core agent

A core planner over the `__AGENTS_PACKAGE__` domain agents. The core works out which
domain agents a question needs, delegates tasks to them in process, checks that
every observed outcome is explained, runs one gap round if not, and writes one
answer with citations. Domain agents are imported objects, not network services.
Expose the core itself through whichever agent SDK adapter you need.

```bash
pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
__DIST__ validate
__DIST__ eval
__DIST__ ask ORD-1 "Why was this order rejected?" --trace
pytest
```
